      edit rights decision applied.
      Acceptance: a festival shows editions by year with who went; a place page lists its events.
    </detail>
    <detail name="Phase 4 — Music (M2, part 1) [later]">
      Work: Spotify app and server-side search route (client credentials); Artist and Performance entities
